  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#event-submit\r\n\r\n> Event | Interface\r\n> --- | ---\r\n> submit | Event\r\n\r\n`submit` event's interface seems to be `SubmitEvent`, as [the only direct usage](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#form-submission-algorithm:event-submit) describes,\r\n\r\n> firing an event named `submit` at form using **SubmitEvent**",
